  "findings": [
    "All three boot kernels are byte-identical.",
    "All three vendor_boot DTBs and DTBO entries differ.",
    "Official and Lineage enable protected VM; EvolutionX disables it.",
    "Only LineageOS 0704 adds androidboot.selinux=permissive.",
    "Each vendor ramdisk has 434 modules; official uses mi_wq_dynamic_priority.ko where both custom ROMs use miloadtrace.ko.",
    "The custom ROMs share 404 byte-identical modules that differ from official 3.0.304, so kernel and vendor modules must be kept as a coherent set."
  ],
