    "findings": [
      "Each vendor ramdisk carries 434 kernel modules, but the official set replaces miloadtrace.ko with mi_wq_dynamic_priority.ko.",
      "EvolutionX and LineageOS have identical normal and recovery module load lists.",
      "Among 433 common modules, 404 are byte-identical between EvolutionX and LineageOS while differing from official 3.0.304; 20 differ across all three; 9 are identical across all three.",
      "CS40L26 and speed_touch modules are byte-identical between EvolutionX and LineageOS but differ from official 3.0.304.",
      "The shared boot kernel does not make vendor ramdisk module sets interchangeable; keep kernel, DTB/DTBO, modules and load metadata as one coherent baseline."
    ]
